## Document Title

Use `documentTitle` to set the PDF metadata title and render a visible title above the table. Pass a `PdfCell` to configure the title's font, colour, border, padding, margin, alignment, and wrapping.

{% gridExampleRunner title="Document Title" name="pdf-document-title" exampleHeight=520 /%}

## Custom Content

Use `prependContent`, `appendContent`, or `getCustomContentBelowRow` to add content that is not displayed in the grid. Strings are split into full-width rows. Use `PdfCell[][]` for explicit spans and styling.

{% gridExampleRunner title="Custom Content" name="pdf-custom-content" exampleHeight=520 /%}

